# API 2.4-3.1 compatible compact build for older 240x240 MIP targets and
# the API 3.0 Approach S62. F7S/F7S Pro remain on the modern Round240 profile.
# Assigning sourcePath replaces the modern View,
# so legacy binaries never reference Weather, SensorHistory or VectorFont.
